note leak fixture (call rule, README.txt): the helper returns a loaded byte; the caller branches on
note the returned value. The callee's exit summary carries x0 = data back to the call site, so the
note caller's branch is data MANUAL under E12. Expected: TRACE-EQUIV-STATIC NOT_RUN.
fn h a view uchar 16 to ulong
ret ulong get a 3
end
fn f a view uchar 16 to ulong
if gt h a 9
ret 2
end
ret 5
end
